doc('APPROVED_SOURCE_BINDINGS.md','# Human-approved sources and protected ownership\n\nApproval authority: the explicit user request MINUET_STAGE_C_R1_DUAL_HAND_SYNCHRONIZED_PERFORMANCE dated2026-10-10. Both named sources are HUMAN_VISUAL_APPROVED_WITH_ENGINEERING_WARN, covering their original single-hand performances only. Their older FINAL_STATUS files still say HUMAN_PENDING; these historical reports are preserved, not rewritten or falsely used as a newer approval receipt. Dual-hand Human approval remains pending.\n\n'+ '\n\n'.join(f"{s}: `{b['manifest']['path']}`\n\nSource SHA256 `{b['manifest']['sha256']}`; scene `{b['manifest']['scene']}`. Original root/rig/mesh mapping `{b['manifest']['mapping']}`. Numeric motion SHA256 `{b['motion_sha256']}`. Original timeline SHA256 `{b['timeline_sha256']}`. Engineering diagnostics SHA256 `{b['engineering_diagnostics_sha256']}`." for s,b in B.items())+'\n\n| Hand | Owner | Original object | Actual source Action | Actual slot | Source Action payload SHA256 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n'+'\n'.join(source_rows)+f'\n\nActual FK, root motion, joint quaternion curves, key curves, corrective bindings and audio source event relationships were read from these exact saved Blends and approved data. Neither a failed original R3 nor older R1 was substituted. Original Grand sample chain is linked in AUDIO_INTEGRATION.json; source audio/timeline/data files are protected in the full snapshot. All{len(before)} current protected files, including the entire approved source audit directories and frozen input union, match the pre-work SHA snapshot. The four approved static scene core SHA values match both approved scene manifests. No frozen geometry/Rig/weights/Actions on disk were modified.\n')
